04:03:19,310 --> 04:03:20,470
...they never made it that far.

4217
04:03:21,210 --> 04:03:23,470
They got to Ginny, and I rescued Ginny...

4218
04:03:23,470 --> 04:03:24,010
...just in time.

4219
04:03:24,290 --> 04:03:25,130
From slaughter.

4220
04:03:26,730 --> 04:03:29,210
So, lucky for Ginny, I was there.

4221
04:03:32,640 --> 04:03:33,900
Gold ingot over here.

4222
04:03:34,960 --> 04:03:36,220
Pufferfish is actually brewing.

4223
04:03:37,620 --> 04:03:38,140
Yep.

4224
04:03:40,560 --> 04:03:41,280
Coal there.

4225
04:03:42,260 --> 04:03:42,740
Nice.

4226
04:03:43,340 --> 04:03:45,420
Also, we're gonna have, of course, redstone...

4227
04:03:47,620 --> 04:03:49,200
...chests in the redstone room.

4228
04:03:53,240 --> 04:03:53,900
Hell yeah.

4229
04:03:55,080 --> 04:03:56,780
This is starting to come together.

4230
04:03:56,960 --> 04:03:57,940
