4231
04:03:58,260 --> 04:03:59,880
I know this is silly, but...

4232
04:04:01,340 --> 04:04:02,080
...look at that.

4233
04:04:03,580 --> 04:04:06,100
Doesn't that just tie the world together?

4234
04:04:06,360 --> 04:04:08,020
Just like that rug in that one movie?

4235
04:04:10,760 --> 04:04:11,420
It's so good.

4236
04:04:12,140 --> 04:04:13,540
Okay, it's time to go to the logout spot.

4237
04:04:22,560 --> 04:04:23,240
In fact, no, no.

4238
04:04:23,380 --> 04:04:25,120
We're gonna change the logout spot to be here now...

4239
04:04:25,120 --> 04:04:25,780
...so we can see that.

4240
04:04:28,710 --> 04:04:29,210
Right there.

4241
04:04:37,950 --> 04:04:39,170
Oh shit, the cam is live.

4242
04:04:39,510 --> 04:04:40,070
Oh, hold on.

4243
04:04:40,670 --> 04:04:42,090
