4249
04:05:00,560 --> 04:05:01,560
You saw me.

4250
04:05:03,020 --> 04:05:04,200
I'm sitting in the dark.

4251
04:05:14,180 --> 04:05:15,660
I like the squished version.

4252
04:05:23,980 --> 04:05:27,220
Oliver, I don't think major crimes will approve of your quartz floor.

4253
04:05:27,220 --> 04:05:29,660
That's where you're wrong, Roy33.

4254
04:05:30,240 --> 04:05:49,200
Because in the Major Crimes Manual, section 14, paragraph 3, it clearly states that any levitating floor needs to be supported by at least four pillars of the same type of stone as the floor itself.

4255
04:05:50,140 --> 04:05:57,500
No more than seven blocks away from the edge, which is exactly how I built it.

4256
04:05:57,900 --> 04:05:58,920
Everything is up to spec.

4257
04:05:59,660 --> 04:06:00,540
Don't you worry.

4258
04:06:02,100 --> 04:06:04,340
I'm disappointed you didn't name it e-book, Oliver.

4259
04:06:04,620 --> 04:06:06,200
The thing is, it's a physical book.

4260
04:06:07,660 --> 04:06:10,120
E-book is not the right one.

4261
04:06:15,120 --> 04:06:17,340
Why don't you look at the Enderman, my potatoes.

4262
04:06:17,660 --> 04:06:18,840
I'm sorry, Shushinase.

4263
04:06:25,200 --> 04:06:26,560
But it's digital, though.

4264
04:06:27,340 --> 04:06:28,200
That's what you think.

4265
04:06:28,640 --> 04:06:30,220
It is actually not.

4266
04:06:33,400 --> 04:06:38,040
The thing is, it's called the Book of Preparation.

4267
04:06:38,940 --> 04:06:41,880
But it's also known as the e-book of preparation.

4268
04:06:43,320 --> 04:06:44,920
It's a slang name for it.

4269
04:06:45,560 --> 04:06:46,420
He lost 40k.

4270
04:06:46,560 --> 04:06:47,240
I'm sorry.

4271
04:06:47,700 --> 04:06:48,340
No.

4272
04:06:50,080 --> 04:06:51,360
I apologize.

4273
04:06:53,200 --> 04:06:59,740
Oh, a lot of you actually predicted that I wouldn't continue to have zero deaths.

4274
04:07:03,710 --> 04:07:04,670
Here's your potatoes.

4275
04:07:05,810 --> 04:07:06,830
Congrats to the winners.

4276
04:07:08,230 --> 04:07:09,690
And I'm sorry to the losers.

4277
04:07:11,010 --> 04:07:12,710
Is this going to be a forever world?

4278
04:07:12,810 --> 04:07:14,030
What does that mean, damn daddy?

4279
04:07:15,670 --> 04:07:16,630
I guess it is.

4280
04:07:16,790 --> 04:07:18,330
I mean, if it's what I think it is.

4281
04:07:20,650 --> 04:07:23,230
Also, I wanted to do a bunch of redstone today, but then...

4282
04:07:23,230 --> 04:07:23,950
So, here's the thing.

4283
04:07:24,070 --> 04:07:28,550
I came into this dream thinking, Dude, I have these great ideas for projects.

4284
04:07:28,890 --> 04:07:30,110
And I'm going to do it today.

4285
04:07:30,770 --> 04:07:34,850
But then I realized immediately, I'm going to be hating my life to no end.

4286
04:07:35,130 --> 04:07:37,070
Because I don't have room to experiment with.

4287
04:07:37,530 --> 04:07:38,890
So, it turned into a...

4288
04:07:38,890 --> 04:07:40,250
Let's make a room for redstone.

4289
04:07:40,810 --> 04:07:42,990
So that we can properly do the experiments.

4290
04:07:44,170 --> 04:07:45,050
I think...

4291
04:07:45,050 --> 04:07:46,810
That it was a good investment.

4292
04:07:55,000 --> 04:07:56,400
That room will fill up quick.

4293
04:07:57,180 --> 04:07:58,980
I mean, it's not supposed to be...

4294
04:07:58,980 --> 04:08:00,560
I make a machine and leave it there.

4295
04:08:00,860 --> 04:08:01,660
It's going to...

4296
04:08:01,660 --> 04:08:02,500
Just for experiments.

4297
04:08:03,340 --> 04:08:04,600
I make something cool.

4298
04:08:04,880 --> 04:08:06,840
I note it down in my books, my findings.

4299
04:08:07,060 --> 04:08:07,960
And then I delete the machine.

4300
04:08:09,440 --> 04:08:10,320
It's just...

4301
04:08:10,820 --> 04:08:11,600
Experimentation grounds.

4302
04:08:12,140 --> 04:08:13,220
That's what I'm imagining.

4303
04:08:15,620 --> 04:08:16,540
Cool beacons.

4304
04:08:17,200 --> 04:08:17,980
Poor man beacons.

4305
04:08:18,080 --> 04:08:18,500
I love them.

4306
04:08:18,660 --> 04:08:19,460
They're so beautiful.

4307
04:08:21,220 --> 04:08:22,660
The bacon is cool AF.

4308
04:08:23,080 --> 04:08:23,680
Yeah, isn't it?

4309
04:08:25,680 --> 04:08:26,140
Aquarelic.

4310
04:08:26,260 --> 04:08:27,000
Thanks for subbing, man.

4311
04:08:27,180 --> 04:08:28,620
It was a very cozy stream, though.

4312
04:08:28,720 --> 04:08:29,340
I appreciate it.

4313
04:08:30,480 --> 04:08:31,140
And Roy...

4314
04:08:32,220 --> 04:08:32,680
Royster59.

4315
04:08:33,000 --> 04:08:34,420
Thank you for subbing also.

4316
04:08:34,620 --> 04:08:35,300
Six months now.

4317
04:08:36,140 --> 04:08:36,820
What's that?

4318
04:08:39,000 --> 04:08:40,420
It's Crimson Diorite.

4319
04:08:40,680 --> 04:08:41,460
Am I right?

4320
04:08:43,100 --> 04:08:44,120
My name packs.

4321
04:08:44,300 --> 04:08:45,680
Also subbed four hours ago.

4322
04:08:45,800 --> 04:08:46,160
Thank you, man.

4323
04:08:46,760 --> 04:08:47,180
Thank you, guys.

4324
04:08:47,980 --> 04:08:49,080
Beacons are awesome, yeah.

4325
04:08:50,560 --> 04:08:52,500
That smoke beacon you used is really cool.

4326
04:08:53,540 --> 04:08:55,140
It's such a simple design.

4327
04:08:56,240 --> 04:09:00,380
So, what I originally envisioned was that all of the...

4328
04:09:02,000 --> 04:09:02,900
What do you call it?

4329
04:09:04,460 --> 04:09:07,860
The campfires would be right on top of each other, so they would sort of interlock.

4330
04:09:08,360 --> 04:09:10,740
Into one big beacon.

4331
04:09:11,520 --> 04:09:13,960
But the fact that they float kind of ruined my plan.

4332
04:09:17,790 --> 04:09:19,470
I'm learning redstone vicariously from you?

4333
04:09:19,910 --> 04:09:20,670
Hey, really?

4334
04:09:21,110 --> 04:09:21,890
That's awesome.

4335
04:09:23,110 --> 04:09:24,570
You didn't learn much today, though.

4336
04:09:24,830 --> 04:09:25,690
Because I didn't do much.

4337
04:09:27,730 --> 04:09:29,690
You made me understand redstone better?

4338
04:09:29,850 --> 04:09:30,790
Hey, that's awesome!

4339
04:09:32,850 --> 04:09:34,250
Glad to have been of assistance.

4340
04:09:36,770 --> 04:09:38,210
I'm also learning a lot about it.

4341
04:09:38,690 --> 04:09:39,550
It's super cool.

4342
04:09:47,140 --> 04:09:47,900
They got an...

4343
04:09:47,900 --> 04:09:49,560
Yeah, they have to add combining half blocks.

4344
04:09:49,700 --> 04:09:50,840
That really annoyed me in the moment.

4345
04:09:50,980 --> 04:09:51,380
But you know what?

4346
04:09:51,380 --> 04:09:53,420
I actually kind of like my pillars in each corner.

4347
04:09:54,480 --> 04:09:55,500
The supporting pillars.

4348
04:09:59,390 --> 04:10:00,570
Hey, what's up, Acha...

4349
04:10:00,570 --> 04:10:01,830
Acha Telenko.

4350
04:10:02,130 --> 04:10:03,530
First time catching a stream with you?

4351
04:10:03,610 --> 04:10:04,170
I appreciate it.

4352
04:10:04,530 --> 04:10:05,390
Glad to have you.

4353
04:10:05,850 --> 04:10:06,870
I hope you enjoyed it.

4354
04:10:07,710 --> 04:10:10,670
Even though it was a lot of just mining cobblestone today.

4355
04:10:11,630 --> 04:10:12,410
I just...

4356
04:10:12,410 --> 04:10:13,410
I mined a big hole.

4357
04:10:13,590 --> 04:10:14,990
That's what I did today.

4358
04:10:16,310 --> 04:10:17,250
Oh, that's not true.

4359
04:10:17,310 --> 04:10:20,370
I also went to the nether and mined a lot of nether quartz.

4360
04:10:21,330 --> 04:10:22,190
And died.

4361
04:10:22,390 --> 04:10:22,570
Yeah.

4362
04:10:24,930 --> 04:10:27,090
I appreciated Los Alamos part 2.

4363
04:10:27,450 --> 04:10:36,930
Dude, I was briefly thinking I should wire up all those explosives with one redstone signal.

4364
04:10:37,470 --> 04:10:40,650
And have them all go off at the same time with, like, a trigger.

4365
04:10:41,230 --> 04:10:43,850
But I thought, ah, I don't want to bother with that.

4366
04:10:47,100 --> 04:10:49,760
You're definitely planning to make a sex dungeon at first?

4367
04:10:49,880 --> 04:10:50,160
What?

4368
04:10:50,300 --> 04:10:50,920
No way.

4369
04:10:51,800 --> 04:10:53,360
I would never do such a thing.

4370
04:10:56,260 --> 04:10:57,420
At least not publicly.

4371
04:10:58,480 --> 04:11:00,540
Those things need to be kept real secret.

4372
04:11:01,280 --> 04:11:03,260
Otherwise, they're not really sex dungeons, you know?

4373
04:11:03,340 --> 04:11:04,940
You can't have a public sex dungeon.

4374
04:11:04,960 --> 04:11:05,580
It's not the same.

4375
04:11:11,020 --> 04:11:12,760
Ah, so you have one already.

4376
04:11:16,480 --> 04:11:19,860
Thought you were going to trap all the redstone birds in the bat cave.

4377
04:11:20,800 --> 04:11:22,300
No, that was not the plan.

4378
04:11:23,040 --> 04:11:23,860
But you know what?

4379
04:11:23,940 --> 04:11:28,700
The best part is that while I'm down there, those flying bitches are not going to annoy me.

4380
04:11:29,100 --> 04:11:30,180
They can't get to me.

4381
04:11:30,880 --> 04:11:32,520
Unless they somehow spawn in there.

4382
04:11:34,320 --> 04:11:35,200
It's just random.

4383
04:11:39,620 --> 04:11:41,720
What's that room in the community center for then?

4384
04:11:41,840 --> 04:11:43,640
It's going to be sort of an observatory.

4385
04:11:44,100 --> 04:11:45,680
It'll be a place.

4386
04:11:46,260 --> 04:11:48,200
Maybe it'll have to be a small museum.

4387
04:11:49,000 --> 04:11:52,160
Where we note down accomplishments in the world.

4388
04:11:53,220 --> 04:11:56,540
You know, on this and this date, I did that.

4389
04:11:57,280 --> 04:12:03,720
And if you look to the east, you'll see the village that I tried to defend with my life and failed.

4390
04:12:03,920 --> 04:12:04,840
Meaning I survived.

4391
04:12:05,120 --> 04:12:06,280
But everyone else died.

4392
04:12:06,840 --> 04:12:08,120
That sort of thing, you know?

4393
04:12:08,680 --> 04:12:13,080
And then people can go up there and really get to know the history behind the village they're a part of.

4394
04:12:16,240 --> 04:12:18,140
That's going to be the point of the community center.

4395
04:12:18,840 --> 04:12:20,760
And then there's going to be refreshments downstairs.

4396
04:12:21,440 --> 04:12:22,860
We're going to have a ping pong table.

4397
04:12:23,220 --> 04:12:24,000
They're going to love it.

4398
04:12:25,340 --> 04:12:28,400
Too bad for Samantha, Ron, and Jeremy.

4399
04:12:28,620 --> 04:12:29,340
They're not going to see it.

4400
04:12:30,280 --> 04:12:32,800
Jeremy was one of the founding people of this village.

4401
04:12:34,820 --> 04:12:35,340
But yeah.

4402
04:12:37,100 --> 04:12:38,340
Hey, Blobpoly, you're late.

4403
04:12:38,580 --> 04:12:38,960
Too bad.

4404
04:12:39,660 --> 04:12:40,980
You can always catch the VOD.

4405
04:12:43,360 --> 04:12:44,080
Air hockey?

4406
04:12:48,080 --> 04:12:50,800
You have so many plans, you've got to start streaming every day, Oliver.

4407
04:12:51,300 --> 04:12:52,180
Yeah, I guess I do.

4408
04:12:52,920 --> 04:12:53,460
Who knows?

4409
04:12:53,560 --> 04:12:54,640
Maybe that will be my future.

4410
04:13:01,840 --> 04:13:07,340
But it's definitely going to be a world that I will be working on for a long, long time.

4411
04:13:08,220 --> 04:13:11,900
So I guess a forever world is very appropriate naming.

4412
04:13:15,440 --> 04:13:17,600
Can we have a Gen Z slang guide at the museum?

4413
04:13:17,920 --> 04:13:18,580
Points at the beacon.

4414
04:13:18,700 --> 04:13:19,280
This is lit.

4415
04:13:20,240 --> 04:13:21,040
I like it.

4416
04:13:22,560 --> 04:13:23,320
I like it.

4417
04:13:23,720 --> 04:13:24,760
It's a little bit edgy.

4418
04:13:25,800 --> 04:13:26,900
A little bit cringy.

4419
04:13:27,060 --> 04:13:27,640
But I like that.

4420
04:13:32,600 --> 04:13:34,640
I'm not trying to rush anything in this world, though.

4421
04:13:34,760 --> 04:13:36,680
I take my sweet time with it and I'm having a blast.

4422
04:13:41,620 --> 04:13:44,620
There's a Museum V2 in progress for the end of the series.

4423
04:13:45,560 --> 04:13:46,440
Museum V2.

4424
04:13:48,400 --> 04:13:49,300
But that's the thing.

4425
04:13:49,460 --> 04:13:51,460
I don't know if this will ever truly end in a way.

4426
04:13:51,800 --> 04:13:56,120
Maybe the frequency of streams will maybe at some point in the future be less.

4427
04:13:56,580 --> 04:13:59,740
But it's going to be one of those worlds that I will probably never stop.

4428
04:14:03,890 --> 04:14:04,450
You know?

4429
04:14:06,130 --> 04:14:09,250
The first season was me dipping my toes into Minecraft.

4430
04:14:09,890 --> 04:14:12,050
The second season is me playing Minecraft.

4431
04:14:15,840 --> 04:14:16,980
That's how I like to see it.

4432
04:14:21,160 --> 04:14:22,980
Minecraft 12 hours a day every day?

4433
04:14:23,320 --> 04:14:24,740
What about World of Warcraft, then?

4434
04:14:25,300 --> 04:14:26,480
What do I do about Classic?

4435
04:14:32,730 --> 04:14:34,030
Oh, that actually reminds me.

4436
04:14:34,070 --> 04:14:35,090
I forgot to take a break today.

4437
04:14:35,170 --> 04:14:35,550
But that's okay.

4438
04:14:35,790 --> 04:14:36,470
I survived.

4439
04:14:40,020 --> 04:14:41,320
Do you have the other 12 hours?

4440
04:14:41,460 --> 04:14:42,260
Man, I wish I could.

4441
04:14:42,460 --> 04:14:43,420
I hate sleeping.

4442
04:14:44,240 --> 04:14:45,920
It's such a waste of time in life.

4443
04:14:47,220 --> 04:14:47,860
Think about it.

4444
04:14:47,900 --> 04:14:49,580
You could live twice as long if you didn't sleep.

4445
04:14:49,780 --> 04:14:50,280
Oh, man.

4446
04:14:50,400 --> 04:14:51,020
I would love to.

4447
04:14:53,060 --> 04:14:54,280
You're going to play Rogue, Blanky?

4448
04:14:54,360 --> 04:14:54,800
I love it.

4449
04:14:55,720 --> 04:14:56,420
Are you on EU?

4450
04:15:01,140 --> 04:15:02,740
There's a WoW map GeoGuessr.

4451
04:15:02,820 --> 04:15:03,940
If you ever want to stream, that could be...

4452
04:15:03,940 --> 04:15:05,520
Oh, that's a great idea, Aquarelic.

4453
04:15:06,280 --> 04:15:07,200
We should do that once.

4454
04:15:10,600 --> 04:15:11,420
I could do that.

4455
04:15:12,480 --> 04:15:13,580
Although only for Classic.

4456
04:15:13,820 --> 04:15:15,400
I don't know much about the rest.

4457
04:15:16,200 --> 04:15:17,200
At least not that much.

4458
04:15:17,200 --> 04:15:17,720
I don't remember.

4459
04:15:19,240 --> 04:15:21,200
Oh, I guess I don't sleep for 12 hours.

4460
04:15:21,760 --> 04:15:22,680
More like 7.

4461
04:15:28,460 --> 04:15:29,260
More kidnapping.

4462
04:15:29,520 --> 04:15:29,680
Oh, yeah.

4463
04:15:29,760 --> 04:15:30,480
We got to do more kidnapping.

4464
04:15:33,500 --> 04:15:34,880
Think about their fate.

4465
04:15:35,380 --> 04:15:39,380
We kidnapped them to this random-ass village that was in its early days.

4466
04:15:40,500 --> 04:15:42,420
And I tried to protect them and they just died.

4467
04:15:43,320 --> 04:15:45,100
And nobody will know what happened to them.

4468
04:15:46,240 --> 04:15:47,340
if they actually died.

4469
04:15:47,480 --> 04:15:47,800
I don't know.

4470
04:15:50,200 --> 04:15:52,040
I actually never did stream that blob.

4471
04:15:52,700 --> 04:15:54,720
It was just something I recorded for fun.

4472
04:15:55,540 --> 04:15:56,920
It was more like a...

4473
04:15:56,920 --> 04:16:00,860
I wanted to see my progress of learning Japanese.

4474
04:16:02,460 --> 04:16:04,300
That was mostly the recording reason.

4475
04:16:04,520 --> 04:16:06,380
I mean, I didn't really have any subscribers back then.

4476
04:16:06,580 --> 04:16:07,500
Nobody was watching that.

